  "fullDescription": "This charming clipart features a whimsical tooth fairy mouse, beautifully illustrated in a delicate watercolor style. The mouse, adorned with tiny wings and a sparkling tiara, is surrounded by lush pink peonies that add a touch of elegance and sweetness to the scene. The soft pastel colors and gentle brush strokes create a dreamy atmosphere, making this artwork perfect for children’s projects, invitations, or any creative endeavor that celebrates the magic of childhood and dental milestones. The combination of the adorable mouse and the vibrant flowers brings a sense of joy and enchantment, inviting viewers into a world of fantasy and wonder.\n\nThis Collection includes: 15 x Elements | PNG (300 dpi) in ZIP\n\nImportant! Fonts are not included in the collection\nIf you like my style of drawing, then I invite you to my store. Here you will find more such products in a romantic style 🙂\nI will be very glad if you share what you did with my illustrations, as well as your positive feedback.",
